  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Avian and Human Influenza Control and Preparedness Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall development objective of the Project is to contribute to Government&apos;s National Plan which aims to minimize the threat posed to humans and the poultry sectors by highly pathogenic avian influenza (HPAI) infection and other zoonoses in Lao PDR, and to prepare for, control, and respond to influenza pandemics and other infectious disease emergencies in humans.</narrative>
  </description>
